{
  "id": "boss_castellan_odrun",
  "name": "Castellan Odrun the Oathbroken",
  "tier": "boss",
  "body": "cult_zealot",
  "place": "dungeon fortress_keep set A: the end boss in the great hall (28 m)",
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). The keep's commander, who opened the gates to the cult. P1 \"Hold the Hall\": a halberd for the tank, a sweeping arc, and the BALLISTA on the gallery firing lines across the hall (it fires at whoever he points at — a line from the far wall). Barricades are cover from his War Cry. P2 at 60% \"The Gate\": he raises a ward of oaths and calls his guard; the PORTCULLIS LEVER drops the gate on the guard (hurts the boss too), and the three BURNING-OIL braziers break the ward. P3 new bar \"Oathbroken\": rings of fire from spilled oil, a three-player stack, the ballista now fires a cross, and he tries to raise the banner (interrupt) for an enrage.",
  "party": "Solo: needs a follower. 2-3: tank + runner for braziers/lever. 5: as designed. M5: guard count +1 per player, health x1.8 at 5, ballista shots +1 for 4+.",
  "hpMult": 4,
